{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/Steam_600x114_Text-Block_EN.jpg?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a cataclysmic event, Hunters were created by mankind to safeguard the collection of an extraterrestrial resource crucial to human survival, known as Starfall. Driven by ruthless factions, these fearsome mechanical giants have now become the key to dominate the scarce resource across the ruins of a green but abandoned Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/01._ENgif.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover multiple Hunter playstyles and their destructive weapons, gear, mods, and abilities. Unleash raw power and obliterate your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/02_EN.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elevate your teamwork in the hunting grounds. Mastering your Hunters' unique abilities will keep you alive, but it's only by displaying perfect team synergy that you'll secure a victorious extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/03._ENgif.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick reflexes alone won't cut it. Instead, sound tactics will carve your path to extract with Starfall. Will you charge headfirst through other teams or exploit the terrain to outmaneuver them? Every hunt matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/04_WTF_.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Hunter favors a distinct playstyle and has a unique progression system, making them a true menace in battle. Collect boosters and gear to gain an advantage in combat against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/05.ENgif.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of an unstoppable machine. Smash through buildings to ambush your rivals or use structures as cover until they collapse under enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/06_EN.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the land to pursue dynamic objectives with multiple PvE encounters. Just keep in mind that when you're not hunting, you're being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ready for Action","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/c3f889e2991f14362ec5f4fe25a0b3dae58df8c8.jpg"},{"name":"Two Is an Army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/a2ac448309933ea4eceb84be424740738b4460a6.jpg"},{"name":"Need a Bigger Hangar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/8a3cefa4ea267af19d31952be2e86a659425830d.jpg"},{"name":"Full House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/9f7ef161db53462c2d02cb245d218e017ab805d0.jpg"},{"name":"Baptism by Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/75cf07046732ff203dca125024fbb0acce8618b8.jpg"},{"name":"Hunting Day and Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/67e63f34be00421e614c0a5902671fbe87ffa0dd.jpg"},{"name":"Steel Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/7c5d0113c95d80c1a5bf2386763b8d6b95afe00b.jpg"},{"name":"Booted Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/ddc52cbce8b63ff7c7ba0ea3aa320becffe829ef.jpg"},{"name":"Locked and Noded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/6d1c3facbddbce11b9bfb5ffd3a23ad98b0670a2.jpg"},{"name":"System Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1691340/80a398eefa43d5dbc4b824b75c35c9b13f33e35d.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1691340?t=1746022728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/d166dd7c51ccf9ca65ae2b944eb59499361b2c08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746022728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/dfa256de71e4fe250cb0b25aa78c0b0a59e6f66e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746022728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/dfa256de71e4fe250cb0b25aa78c0b0a59e6f66e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746022728","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Global Launch</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/v040_Steam_Special-Block_610x230_Early-Access-Play-for-Free.jpg?t=1746022728\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/Steam_600x114_Text-Block_EN.jpg?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a cataclysmic event, Hunters were created by mankind to safeguard the collection of an extraterrestrial resource crucial to human survival, known as Starfall. Driven by ruthless factions, these fearsome mechanical giants have now become the key to dominate the scarce resource across the ruins of a green but abandoned Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/01._ENgif.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover multiple Hunter playstyles and their destructive weapons, gear, mods, and abilities. Unleash raw power and obliterate your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/02_EN.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elevate your teamwork in the hunting grounds. Mastering your Hunters' unique abilities will keep you alive, but it's only by displaying perfect team synergy that you'll secure a victorious extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/03._ENgif.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick reflexes alone won't cut it. Instead, sound tactics will carve your path to extract with Starfall. Will you charge headfirst through other teams or exploit the terrain to outmaneuver them? Every hunt matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/04_WTF_.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Hunter favors a distinct playstyle and has a unique progression system, making them a true menace in battle. Collect boosters and gear to gain an advantage in combat against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/05.ENgif.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of an unstoppable machine. Smash through buildings to ambush your rivals or use structures as cover until they collapse under enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/06_EN.gif?t=1746022728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the land to pursue dynamic objectives with multiple PvE encounters. Just keep in mind that when you're not hunting, you're being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Wargaming Group Limited"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Wargaming.net (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/34553449dea677d7b082844a79051bdee8c66b38/header.jpg?t=1746022728","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 . All rights reserved. \"Steel Hunters\", \"\" and \"Wargaming\" and their respective logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of Wargaming. You may not use or display such trademarks in any manner, except as expressly permitted in legal documents of Wargaming","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121247,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.aka